# Feature branch before coding (hard gate)

**禁止**在未开本任务专用分支前开始功能编码（含多文件行为改动、确认方案后的 implement）。

> 与 restaurant-ordering 同口径；本仓（farvoo-fatura）强制执行。

## Before the first product edit

1. `git branch --show-current` + `git status -sb`
2. Create/switch to a **new** branch from **`main`** (or user-named baseline) for **this** task only
3. If the checkout has **unrelated dirty WIP**, use a **separate git worktree** — do not edit on another task’s branch; do not stash their WIP to “borrow” the tree
4. Shell only: `git checkout -b` / `git worktree add` — **never** `move_agent_to_root` / `move_agent_to_cloned_root` for branch switches

Only then may you edit product code for the feature.

## Forbidden

- Coding a feature on `main`
- Coding a feature on an **unrelated** feature branch (e.g. home workbench on `fix/admin-x-scroll`)
- “先改几行再开分支” / 确认方案后直接 Write/StrReplace 而不先开分支

## Exceptions (no new branch required)

- Pure analyze / read-only / plan turns (no product edits)
- User explicitly says work on the **current** branch / continue this branch
- Typo / one-line fix / docs-only / lint-only that the user asked to apply in place
- Rule/skill/docs updates the user asked for in-thread (this file)

## After land

Follow [`git-local-merge-push.mdc`](./git-local-merge-push.mdc): merge to local `main` only when asked; then delete this task’s feature branch/worktree and return to `main`.
